  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5I8S\r\n\r\nWhether you're a busy professional, downsizer, investor, or simply looking for an effortless coastal lifestyle, this north-facing, top-level, elevated apartment in the sought-after Shoalhaven complex offers the perfect balance of comfort, convenience, and location.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light, the spacious open plan living and dining area is complemented by a well-equipped kitchen, creating an inviting space for everyday living and entertaining. Sliding doors extend the living area to a sunny balcony overlooking the beautifully maintained recreational area and swimming pool - the perfect spot to unwind or enjoy your morning coffee.\r\n\r\nThe apartment offers two generous bedrooms, including a master suite complete with its own ensuite. A versatile flexi room provides excellent flexibility as a home office, study, nursery, or occasional single bedroom, while a second bathroom comfortably services the remainder of the home.\r\n\r\nPracticality is well catered for with two designated car parks, ample visitor parking, and the security and ease of apartment living, making this an ideal lock-up-and-leave home.\r\nThe location is simply exceptional. Walk to Takapuna Beach for a morning swim or evening stroll, enjoy the vibrant cafes, restaurants, supermarkets, boutique shopping, and Shore City Shopping Centre, or take advantage of the close proximity to North Shore Hospital. Families will appreciate the excellent school zoning, including Takapuna Primary School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls High School, and Takapuna Grammar School. With a bus stop just down the road and easy motorway access, commuting couldn't be easier.\r\n\r\nThe owner is relocating, presenting an outstanding opportunity to secure an affordable low-maintenance home in one of the North Shore's most desirable lifestyle destinations.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
